-+/**
-+ * omap4_cminst_wait_module_idle - wait for a module to be in 'disabled'
-+ * state
-+ * @part: PRCM partition ID that the CM_CLKCTRL register exists in
-+ * @inst: CM instance register offset (*_INST macro)
